        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9ecf4701-17ce-5aea-9afe-4c7fec8e86cd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Han Chae-young, Lee Byung-hun, Lee Jae-kyoo\n- Works: Autumn in My Heart, Delightful Girl Choon-Hyang, Only You, Fireworks, Boys Over Flowers, A Man Called God, Pretty Man, The Influence, Damo, Fashion 70's, Beethoven Virus, The King 2 Hearts, The Fatal Encounter\n- Organizations: KBS2\n- Topics: Korean dramas, television broadcast\n\nFacts:\n- Han Chae-young is known for notable roles in the Korean dramas \"Autumn in My Heart,\" \"Delightful Girl Choon-Hyang,\" \"Only You,\" \"Fireworks,\" \"Boys Over Flowers,\" \"A Man Called God,\" and \"Pretty Man.\"\n- Lee Jae-kyoo directed the television series \"Damo\" in 2003.\n- Lee Jae-kyoo directed the television series \"Fashion 70's\" in 2005.\n- Lee Jae-kyoo directed the television series \"Beethoven Virus\" in 2008.\n- \"Boys Over Flowers\" aired on KBS2 from January 5 to March 31, 2009, on Mondays and Tuesdays at 22:00 for 25 episodes.\n- Lee Jae-kyoo directed the online movie \"The Influence\" in 2010.\n- \"The Influence\" is a four-part online film starring Lee Byung-hun and Han Chae-young.\n- Lee Jae-kyoo directed the television series \"The King 2 Hearts\" in 2012.\n- Lee Jae-kyoo directed \"The Fatal Encounter\" in 2014.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
